---
version: 2.0.2
title: catalogue: grice/invalid-manifest
---
error[grice/invalid-manifest]: Invalid `manifest.toml`

grice reads `manifest.toml` to find the sources of the project's
dependencies, but `packages` in `manifest.toml` isn't a list.

Hint: `gleam deps download` writes it again. If you edited it by hand, undo
or fix the edit.


